ptr click
wait 0.6
ptr glide 960 540 300
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot window-click
note a click inside the foot window closed the app menu
ptr glide 18 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
ptr glide 70 15 200
ptr click
wait 0.6
shot switched
note one click on the app name closed the system menu AND opened the app menu
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot toggled
note a second click on the app name closed it
ptr glide 18 15 300
ptr click
wait 0.6
ptr glide 600 15 200
ptr click
wait 0.5
shot empty-bar
note a click on the bar's empty strip closed it
ptr glide 18 15 300
ptr click
ptr glide 1300 700 300
wait 4.5
shot auto-4s
note still open at 4.5 s
wait 1
shot auto-6s
note closed by itself after 5 s without the pointer
ptr glide 18 15 300
ptr click
ptr glide 60 60 200
wait 8
